# Feature Import Rules

Cross-feature imports must use barrel exports. Deep imports are forbidden.

```typescript
// ✅ Correct
import { useAuth, AuthProvider } from '@/features/auth';

// ❌ Incorrect
import { useAuth } from '@/features/auth/hooks/useAuth';
```

Within the same feature, relative imports are allowed.

For layer rules and feature structure, see `docs/layers.md`.
